{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEP6qTtdnCoqXVjCFvVU", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "搜了 1 次。\n\n**答案：** \"통모짜핫도그\"（芝士热狗）是谐音梗，意思是**最近总睡不好、很累**。\"통모짜\"（整条马苏里拉芝士）读起来像\"통 못 자\"（总是睡不着）。网上先流行起\"芝士热狗因为총 못 자（睡不着）好可怜\"这个梗，后来大家就用这个词说自己睡不好、很疲惫。\n\n反义词是\"요즘잘자쿨냥이\"，意思是最近睡得很好。它把\"통모짜（통 못 자）\"换成\"요즘잘자\"（最近睡得好），把\"핫도그（hot+dog）\"换成\"쿨냥이（cool+cat）\"。\n\n这个梗最早出自哪里不清楚，来源文章的作者也说网上只流传着截图。这篇文章写于 2022 年 11 月，现在的用法可能有变化。\n\nSources:\n- [[Trend A Word #175] 나 요즘 통 못 자~ 그래? 난 요즘잘자쿨냥인데](https://maily.so/trendaword/posts/2nznew8kzp5)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1330, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4287, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1330}, "output_tokens": 2, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:47:31.380Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEP6qCme6uHBMJ5q4PtA"}
